WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.455
Second, direct access.

00:00:01.455 --> 00:00:05.289
Typical media: hard disk, optical disc, solid-state drive.

00:00:05.289 --> 00:00:08.661
You can locate a record directly by address or key.

00:00:08.661 --> 00:00:13.290
Seek time is shorter and more predictable; good for real-time queries.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:19.108
At the course file-access level, so-called random access still counts as direct access —

00:00:19.108 --> 00:00:23.736
do not confuse that with device-level random versus sequential traits.
